GoodBooks API – Schema Design & Indexes
Collections

books

Fields: book_id (int, PK), goodreads_book_id, title, authors, original_publication_year, average_rating, ratings_count, image_url, small_image_url

Indexes:

{ title: 1, authors: 1 } → for text/regex searches

{ average_rating: -1 } → for top-rated queries

{ book_id: 1 } → primary lookup

ratings

Fields: user_id, book_id, rating

Indexes:

{ book_id: 1 } → get all ratings for a book

{ user_id: 1, book_id: 1 } → unique, upsert protection

tags

Fields: tag_id, tag_name

Indexes:

{ tag_id: 1 }

{ tag_name: 1 } → filter/search by tag name

book_tags

Fields: goodreads_book_id, tag_id, count

Indexes:

{ tag_id: 1 }, { goodreads_book_id: 1 } → efficient join/filter

to_read

Fields: user_id, book_id

Indexes:

{ user_id: 1, book_id: 1 } → prevent duplicates, fast lookup